(   [Problem Statement]: A uniform slender structural steel beam of mass m = 120 kg and length L = 4.0 m is hinged at end A and held in a horizontal position by a temporary support at end B. If the support at B is suddenly removed, calculate: \(1\) Initial angular acceleration alpha of the beam, \(2\) Initial linear acceleration of its center of mass G, \(3\) Initial vertical reaction at hinge pin A.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Problem Definition & Moment of Inertia:) Tj
T*
(   Mass: m = 120 kg; Length: L = 4.0 m; Weight W = m * g = 120 * 9.81 = 1177.2 N.) Tj
T*
(   Center of mass G is at midspan: d = L / 2 = 2.0 m from hinge pin A.) Tj
T*
(   Mass moment of inertia about hinge pin A:) Tj
T*
(   I_A = \(1/3\) * m * L^2 = \(1/3\) * 120 * \(4.0\)^2 = 40 * 16 = 640.0 kg-m^2.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Initial Angular Acceleration alpha \(Rotational Equation Sigma M_A = I_A * alpha\):) Tj
T*
(   Immediately upon release, angular velocity is zero \(omega = 0\).) Tj
T*
(   The only force creating a moment about hinge pin A is the gravitational weight W acting at G:) Tj
T*
(   M_A = W * \(L / 2\) = 1177.2 N * 2.0 m = 2354.4 N-m \(clockwise\).) Tj
T*
(   Applying Sigma M_A = I_A * alpha:) Tj
T*
(   2354.4 = 640.0 * alpha) Tj
T*
(   alpha = 2354.4 / 640.0 = 3.679 rad/s^2 \(clockwise\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Initial Linear Acceleration of Center of Mass G \(a_G\):) Tj
T*
(   Center of mass G moves on a circular arc of radius r_G = L / 2 = 2.0 m about A:) Tj
T*
(   - Tangential acceleration: a_Gt = r_G * alpha = 2.0 m * 3.679 rad/s^2 = 7.358 m/s^2 \(downward\).) Tj
T*
(   - Normal acceleration: a_Gn = r_G * omega^2 = 2.0 * \(0\)^2 = 0 m/s^2.) Tj
T*
(   Therefore, total initial acceleration of G is purely vertical: a_G = 7.36 m/s^2 \(downward\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Initial Vertical Reaction at Hinge Pin A \(R_A\):) Tj
T*
(   Applying Newton's translational equation in the vertical direction \(Sigma Fy = m * a_Gy,) Tj
T*
(   downward +\):) Tj
T*
(   W - R_A = m * a_Gt) Tj
T*
(   1177.2 - R_A = 120 * 7.358 = 882.96 N) Tj
T*
(   R_A = 1177.2 - 882.96 = 294.24 N \(directed vertically upward\).) Tj
T*
ET

